# One line away from aa-counter-guard: an interception commits a detachment
# of the three nearest engageable reserve units instead of the whole reserve.
# The guard measure's own cost case is the motivation -- one match logged 870
# intercepts and never massed an attack, so answer-with-everything may be
# buying defence with the offence ([[policy-holding-ground]]).
#
# Three because below the first-wave size a force is a trickle by the
# engine's own rule and ours ([[engine-ai-triggers]]) -- a detachment smaller
# than a wave would re-create at home exactly what raid v1 died of abroad.

name aa-counter-guard-cap
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 3
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
